      "writtenOn": "2026-04-27T20:06:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "AFAIK, LAP mode is not used in production. Lap mode should ensure that the stats are stored and used correctly, but looks like this extreme case wasn\u0027t handled correctly. I guess there might be a minimum number of buffers requested for this mode, but wasn\u0027t explicitly defined. Did you see how many more buffers it tried to access (16 or more?)?",
